{"seq":2,"slug":"supplier-commitment-feedback","title":"供应商承诺回传与差异","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-demand-forecast-collaboration/replenish-recommend-collab/supplier-commitment-feedback","wordCount":1982,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"供应商承诺回传与差异\">供应商承诺回传与差异</h1><p>平台发出一条补货建议，供应商回一个数字。这个来回里最值钱的不是任何一个数字，而是<strong>两个数字之间的差</strong>。建议 4200 件、承诺 3000 件，这 1200 件的差距携带了整个协同体系里最直接的一手信号：平台的需求判断与工厂的产能现实之间到底差在哪里。</p>\n<p>把这条差异管理起来，需要解决三件事：怎么建模建议与承诺的状态机、怎么分类差异的原因、怎么在重试和并发下保证这条链不错乱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-承诺不是单个数字\">核心概念：承诺不是单个数字</h2><p>供应商的回应很少是「同意」或「不同意」这么简单。真实的回应有五种形态，而且经常同时出现：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>回应形态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>平台侧动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全额承诺</td>\n<td>接受建议量与交期</td>\n<td>转采购订单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数量折让</td>\n<td>承诺量低于建议量</td>\n<td>记录缺口，触发缺口处置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交期顺延</td>\n<td>数量接受但交期后移</td>\n<td>重算覆盖天数，必要时补安全库存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拆分承诺</td>\n<td>分批交付（如 60% 本期、40% 下期）</td>\n<td>按批次建行，逐批跟踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拒绝</td>\n<td>无法承接</td>\n<td>触发替代供应商或需求调整</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这五种形态意味着承诺的数据结构必须支持<strong>一行建议对应多行承诺</strong>。把承诺硬塞成一行的字段，会在「拆分承诺」这个形态上直接崩掉，而拆分恰恰是产能受限时的常态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态机-建议的生命周期\">状态机：建议的生命周期</h2><p>建议与承诺的关系需要一个明确的状态机。没有状态机的系统会出现经典乱象：供应商改了承诺但采购单已经按旧承诺下了；或者供应商重复提交两次承诺，系统按两个量都建了单。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; Issued: 平台发布建议&#10;  Issued --&gt; Acknowledged: 供应商确认收到&#10;  Issued --&gt; Expired: 超过响应期未回应&#10;  Acknowledged --&gt; Committed: 全额或部分承诺&#10;  Acknowledged --&gt; Rejected: 明确拒绝&#10;  Acknowledged --&gt; Expired: 超期未决&#10;  Committed --&gt; Superseded: 平台发出修订版建议&#10;  Rejected --&gt; Issued: 换供应商 / 调整需求后重发&#10;  Committed --&gt; Closed: 转采购订单&#10;  Superseded --&gt; [*]&#10;  Expired --&gt; [*]&#10;  Closed --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; Issued: 平台发布建议\n  Issued --&gt; Acknowledged: 供应商确认收到\n  Issued --&gt; Expired: 超过响应期未回应\n  Acknowledged --&gt; Committed: 全额或部分承诺\n  Acknowledged --&gt; Rejected: 明确拒绝\n  Acknowledged --&gt; Expired: 超期未决\n  Committed --&gt; Superseded: 平台发出修订版建议\n  Rejected --&gt; Issued: 换供应商 / 调整需求后重发\n  Committed --&gt; Closed: 转采购订单\n  Superseded --&gt; [*]\n  Expired --&gt; [*]\n  Closed --&gt; [*]</pre><p>状态机里有两条设计要点值得单独讲。第一条是 <code>Expired</code> 必须存在——供应商不回应的建议不能永远悬着，必须有一个响应期（常见 5 个工作日），到期自动失效并进入催办流程。第二条是 <code>Superseded</code>：平台在供应商承诺之后仍然可能发修订版建议（比如客户下单量变了），此时旧建议被取代，但<strong>旧承诺不能被删除</strong>，它要作为历史保留，用于后续的承诺达成率统计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等-让重试安全\">幂等：让重试安全</h2><p>供应商侧的集成质量参差，重复提交是常态：网络超时后重试、定时任务跑了两遍、人工点两次按钮。承诺接口如果没有幂等保护，一次重复提交就会变成双倍下单。</p>\n<p>标准的做法是要求客户端提供幂等键（<code>Idempotency-Key</code>），服务端以 <code>(supplier_id, idempotency_key)</code> 建唯一索引，重复请求返回首次结果而不是报错。第二个保护是版本化的乐观并发，其语义直接借用 HTTP 的条件请求机制：客户端带上它回应的建议版本标识（等价于 <code>If-Match</code> 携带的实体标签），服务端在不匹配时拒绝写入，RFC 9110 把 <code>If-Match</code> 定义为「当且仅当请求中的实体标签与当前所选表示的实体标签匹配时才执行」的预条件（<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html\">RFC 9110 HTTP Semantics, June 2022</a>）。若服务端认为不带条件的写入请求本身就不该被接受，可以返回 428 Precondition Required——该状态码的含义是「源服务器要求请求是有条件的」，其设计目的正是防止客户端在资源可能已被他处修改的情况下覆写它（<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6585.html\">RFC 6585, April 2012</a>）。映射到承诺接口上就是：基于 <code>Superseded</code> 版本的承诺提交返回 412，而不带任何版本信息的裸提交返回 428。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE supplier_commitment (&#10;  id                 bigserial PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  suggestion_id      bigint      NOT NULL REFERENCES replenish_suggestion(id),&#10;  suggestion_version bigint      NOT NULL,          -- 客户端回应的建议版本&#10;  supplier_id        bigint      NOT NULL,&#10;  idempotency_key    text        NOT NULL,&#10;  commit_no          text        NOT NULL,          -- 供应商侧单号，供对账&#10;  status             text        NOT NULL,          -- committed / rejected&#10;  reason_code        text,                          -- capacity / material / price / lead_time&#10;  committed_at       timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  UNIQUE (supplier_id, idempotency_key)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE supplier_commitment_line (&#10;  commitment_id    bigint        NOT NULL REFERENCES supplier_commitment(id),&#10;  supplier_part    text          NOT NULL,&#10;  committed_qty    numeric(14,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  committed_due    date          NOT NULL,&#10;  shortfall_qty    numeric(14,3) GENERATED ALWAYS AS (0) STORED,  -- 占位，见下方视图&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (commitment_id, supplier_part, committed_due)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> supplier_commitment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id                 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  suggestion_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replenish_suggestion(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  suggestion_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 客户端回应的建议版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  supplier_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idempotency_key    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  commit_no          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 供应商侧单号，供对账</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- committed / rejected</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason_code        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- capacity / material / price / lead_time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  committed_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (supplier_id, idempotency_key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> supplier_commitment_line</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  commitment_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> supplier_commitment(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  supplier_part    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  committed_qty    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  committed_due    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shortfall_qty    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) STORED,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 占位，见下方视图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (commitment_id, supplier_part, committed_due)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>拆分行进主键（<code>committed_due</code> 参与主键）是「拆分承诺」形态的直接落地：同一个料号可以有多行，交期不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"差异计算\">差异计算</h3><p>差异不应该在写入时算死，而应该按建议版本与承诺做一次 join 得出，这样才能适应修订版建议带来的重算。</p>\n<h3 id=\"版本对齐为什么不能省\">版本对齐为什么不能省</h3><p>承诺行必须记录它回应的建议版本（<code>suggestion_version</code>），否则在建议被 <code>Superseded</code> 之后，旧承诺与新建议会被错误地配成一对，差异计算立刻失真。把版本号放进承诺表而不是从建议表反查，是因为承诺记录的历史意义在于「供应商当时看到的是哪一版」——这是唯一无法从当前状态推回的字段。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 建议 vs 承诺的逐行差异（数量缺口 + 交期偏移天数）&#10;CREATE VIEW commitment_variance AS&#10;SELECT s.suggestion_no, s.supplier_id, s.supplier_part,&#10;       s.suggested_qty, s.suggested_due_date,&#10;       c.commit_no,&#10;       sum(cl.committed_qty)                        AS committed_qty,&#10;       max(cl.committed_due)                        AS latest_committed_due,&#10;       s.suggested_qty - coalesce(sum(cl.committed_qty), 0) AS qty_gap,&#10;       coalesce(max(cl.committed_due) - s.suggested_due_date, 0) AS due_slip_days&#10;FROM replenish_suggestion s&#10;LEFT JOIN supplier_commitment c&#10;       ON c.suggestion_id = s.id&#10;      AND c.suggestion_version = s.version&#10;      AND c.status = &#39;committed&#39;&#10;LEFT JOIN supplier_commitment_line cl ON cl.commitment_id = c.id&#10;GROUP BY s.id, c.commit_no, s.suggestion_no, s.supplier_id, s.supplier_part,&#10;         s.suggested_qty, s.suggested_due_date;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 建议 vs 承诺的逐行差异（数量缺口 + 交期偏移天数）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> commitment_variance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">suggestion_no</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_part</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">suggested_qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">suggested_due_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">commit_no</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">committed_qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> committed_qty,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">committed_due</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> latest_committed_due,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">suggested_qty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">committed_qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qty_gap,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">committed_due</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">suggested_due_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> due_slip_days</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replenish_suggestion s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> supplier_commitment c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">suggestion_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">suggestion_version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'committed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> supplier_commitment_line cl </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">commitment_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">commit_no</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">suggestion_no</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">supplier_part</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">suggested_qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">suggested_due_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个视图同时给出两个维度的缺口：数量（<code>qty_gap</code>）与时间（<code>due_slip_days</code>）。只跟踪数量是常见疏忽——供应商承诺了全额但交期推迟三周，对供应保障的伤害与数量短缺是一样的，因为需求不会等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"差异的原因分类\">差异的原因分类</h2><p>缺口本身没有行动价值，缺口的原因才有。把原因做成受控词表，协同才有改进的抓手：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;reasonCode&quot;: &quot;capacity_constrained&quot;,&#10;  &quot;reasonTaxonomy&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;capacity_constrained&quot;: &quot;产能受限：产线排满，本期无法承接更多&quot;,&#10;    &quot;material_shortage&quot;: &quot;原料短缺：上游料件到货晚于排产需求&quot;,&#10;    &quot;moq_mismatch&quot;: &quot;起订量冲突：建议量低于供应商最小起订量&quot;,&#10;    &quot;price_disagreement&quot;: &quot;价格未定：新料号或调价期，商务条件未确认&quot;,&#10;    &quot;lead_time_drift&quot;: &quot;提前期偏移：实际提前期长于协同假设值&quot;,&#10;    &quot;demand_disbelief&quot;: &quot;不认可需求：供应商认为预测偏高&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reasonCode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"capacity_constrained\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reasonTaxonomy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"capacity_constrained\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"产能受限：产线排满，本期无法承接更多\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"material_shortage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"原料短缺：上游料件到货晚于排产需求\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"moq_mismatch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"起订量冲突：建议量低于供应商最小起订量\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"price_disagreement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"价格未定：新料号或调价期，商务条件未确认\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lead_time_drift\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"提前期偏移：实际提前期长于协同假设值\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"demand_disbelief\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"不认可需求：供应商认为预测偏高\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"按原因分流处置\">按原因分流处置</h3><p>不同原因的正确处置完全不同，把差异笼统地「记下来」等于没做。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>谁的问题</th>\n<th>处置动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>产能受限</td>\n<td>供应侧</td>\n<td>拆期、协调产能优先级、评估第二供应商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原料短缺</td>\n<td>供应侧（上游）</td>\n<td>提前共享更长地平线的预测，帮助其备料</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>起订量冲突</td>\n<td>参数不一致</td>\n<td>校正建议生成中的 MOQ 参数，回写供应商主数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格未定</td>\n<td>商务流程</td>\n<td>转采购/商务流程，不属预测协同范畴</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提前期偏移</td>\n<td>协同假设错误</td>\n<td>用实际提前期重新估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不认可需求</td>\n<td>信息不对称</td>\n<td>共享置信度与历史准确率，或调整协同深度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>demand_disbelief</code> 这一项最值得警惕。供应商系统性不认可平台预测，通常意味着两件事之一：平台过去的预测确实不准（那就要用<a href=\"../forecast-supplier-decompose/forecast-confidence-share\">预测口径与置信度共享</a>里的分层准确率数据去沟通），或者双方对「需求」的定义不同（平台按终端销量算，工厂按平台的采购量理解，中间差着平台的库存策略）。后者是纯粹的口径问题，一次澄清就能消掉一大片缺口。</p>\n<h3 id=\"升级判据-连续还是偶发\">升级判据：连续还是偶发</h3><p>单次缺口本身不是结论，连续缺口才是。判据必须写成查询而不是靠人肉眼扫——同一料号连续三轮以上因同一原因产生缺口，说明这不是偶发事件而是结构性错配，需要升级到产能规划层面。用轮次数而不是缺口总量做判据，是因为一次巨大的缺口往往来自突发事件（可协商），而连续的小缺口暴露的是系统性问题（不可协商）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 连续出现同类缺口 &gt;= 3 轮的料号，升级为结构性议题&#10;SELECT supplier_id, supplier_part, reason_code,&#10;       count(DISTINCT suggestion_version) AS consecutive_rounds,&#10;       sum(qty_gap)                        AS total_gap&#10;FROM commitment_variance v&#10;JOIN supplier_commitment c ON c.commit_no = v.commit_no&#10;WHERE v.qty_gap &gt; 0&#10;GROUP BY supplier_id, supplier_part, reason_code&#10;HAVING count(DISTINCT suggestion_version) &gt;= 3&#10;ORDER BY total_gap DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 连续出现同类缺口 >= 3 轮的料号，升级为结构性议题</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> supplier_id, supplier_part, reason_code,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> suggestion_version) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> consecutive_rounds,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(qty_gap)                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_gap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> commitment_variance v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> supplier_commitment c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">commit_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">commit_no</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty_gap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> supplier_id, supplier_part, reason_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> suggestion_version) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_gap </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>建议与承诺之间的<strong>差异</strong>是协同体系里信息量最大的信号，比任何一个数字本身都重要。</li>\n<li>承诺有五种形态（全额、折让、顺延、拆分、拒绝），数据结构必须支持一行建议对应多行承诺。</li>\n<li>建议—承诺链需要显式状态机（含 <code>Expired</code> 与 <code>Superseded</code>），且历史承诺不可删除——它是承诺达成率统计的唯一依据。</li>\n<li>幂等键（<code>(supplier_id, idempotency_key)</code> 唯一索引）与建议版本校验是防止重复下单的双重保护。</li>\n<li>差异必须分类到受控词表并各有处置路径；连续多轮同类缺口要升级为结构性议题，而不是继续当偶发事件处理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸：承诺达成率与差异原因分布会沉淀为供应商协同绩效评分的一个维度，见<a href=\"../collab-performance/supplier-collab-score\">供应商协同绩效评分</a>；当差异长期集中在少数供应商身上时，也许该换一种责任分配方式，见<a href=\"vmi-jmi-model-boundary\">VMI/JMI 协同模式边界</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"供应商承诺回传与差异","id":"供应商承诺回传与差异"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：承诺不是单个数字","id":"核心概念-承诺不是单个数字"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机：建议的生命周期","id":"状态机-建议的生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等：让重试安全","id":"幂等-让重试安全"},{"level":3,"text":"差异计算","id":"差异计算"},{"level":3,"text":"版本对齐为什么不能省","id":"版本对齐为什么不能省"},{"level":2,"text":"差异的原因分类","id":"差异的原因分类"},{"level":3,"text":"按原因分流处置","id":"按原因分流处置"},{"level":3,"text":"升级判据：连续还是偶发","id":"升级判据-连续还是偶发"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"补货建议与下单量推荐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-demand-forecast-collaboration/replenish-recommend-collab/replenish-suggestion-generate"},"next":{"title":"VMI/JMI 协同模式边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-demand-forecast-collaboration/replenish-recommend-collab/vmi-jmi-model-boundary"}}